  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TH-CF-Livestock Waste Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objectives are to (a) reduce methane emissions from improved livestock waste management practices through a carbon finance transaction between the World Bank and the project sponsor; and (b) serve as a demonstration for other livestock producers.</narrative>
  </description>
